## 异步编程：Future / Stream / async-await

```mermaid
graph TB
    A[异步编程模型] --> B[Future]
    A --> C[Stream]
    B --> B1[单次异步结果]
    B --> B2[async/await 语法糖]
    B --> B3[Future.wait 并发]
    C --> C1[多次异步事件]
    C --> C2[async*/yield]
    C --> C3[StreamController]
    C --> C4[广播流 vs 单订阅流]
```

### Future 与并发

```dart
Future<Map<String, dynamic>> loadDashboard() async {
  final results = await Future.wait([
    fetchUserProfile(),
    fetchNotifications(),
    fetchRecentActivity(),
  ]);

  return {
    'profile': results[0],
    'notifications': results[1],
    'activity': results[2],
  };
}

Future<String> fetchWithTimeout(Uri uri) {
  return fetchData(uri).timeout(
    const Duration(seconds: 10),
    onTimeout: () => throw TimeoutException('Request timed out'),
  );
}
```

### Stream 生成器与转换

```dart
Stream<int> countdown(int from) async* {
  for (var i = from; i >= 0; i--) {
    await Future.delayed(const Duration(seconds: 1));
    yield i;
  }
}

Stream<String> searchResults(Stream<String> queries) {
  return queries
      .distinct()
      .debounce(const Duration(milliseconds: 300))
      .asyncMap((query) => searchApi(query));
}
```

### StreamController 自定义流

```dart
class EventBus {
  final _controller = StreamController<AppEvent>.broadcast();

  Stream<T> on<T extends AppEvent>() {
    return _controller.stream.whereType<T>();
  }

  void emit(AppEvent event) {
    _controller.add(event);
  }

  void dispose() {
    _controller.close();
  }
}
```

### Future vs Stream 对比

| 维度     | Future              | Stream                        |
| -------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| 值数量   | 单个                | 多个                          |
| 使用场景 | HTTP 请求、文件读取 | WebSocket、传感器、UI 事件    |
| 等待方式 | `await`             | `await for` / `listen`        |
| 生成方式 | `async`             | `async*` / `StreamController` |
| 错误处理 | `try-catch`         | `onError` / `handleError`     |
| 取消     | 不可取消            | `StreamSubscription.cancel()` |

